      "dialogue": [
        {
          "character_ref": "ken",
          "emotion": "happy",
          "text": "Hey, man! Glad you could make it!"
        },
        {
          "character_ref": "ken",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "text": "Not that you had a huge choice in the matter, but still."
        },
        {
          "character_ref": "ken",
          "emotion": "cool",
          "text": "It's nice when people show up for things."
        },
        {
          "character_ref": "ken",
          "emotion": "angry",
          "text": "Listen, you owe me - er, us, money. Like, A LOT of money."
        },
        {
          "character_ref": "ken",
          "emotion": "shocked",
          "text": "Usually I'd just kill you. But I have a small problem."
        },
        {
          "character_ref": "ken",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "text": "This ice cream business we're using as a front - It's totally failing. Like, fucked. And the cops are onto me"
        },
        {
          "character_ref": "ken",
          "emotion": "shocked",
          "text": "That's where you come in!"
        },
        {
          "character_ref": "ken",
          "emotion": "happy",
          "text": "I need you to turn this place around. Like, now."
        },
        {
          "character_ref": "ken",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "text": "I'll give you... let's say 5 days - to turn the place around."
        },
        {
          "character_ref": "ken",
          "emotion": "angry",
          "text": "Or else."
        },
        {
          "character_ref": "ken",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "text": "You'll be in charge of paying the daily rent, buying supplies, and keeping customers happy."
        },
        {
          "character_ref": "ken",
          "emotion": "angry",
          "text": "And don't even think about putting yourself in more debt by being unable to pay rent,"
        },
        {
          "character_ref": "ken",
          "emotion": "angry",
          "text": "'Cause the place will go down. And you'll really be in trouble."
        },
        {
          "character_ref": "ken",
          "emotion": "angry",
          "text": "'If you can keep the place afloat, I'll waive all your debt."
        },
        {
          "character_ref": "ken",
          "emotion": "cool",
          "text": "So don't disappoint me, kay?"
        },
        {
          "character_ref": "ken",
          "emotion": "shocked",
          "text": "Good Luck! And don't fuck it up!",
          "fade_out": true
        }
      ],
      "end_scene": "MainGameScene"
    }
  ]
